  "tier": "told-once",
  "plain": "In 1996, people in the Brazilian town of Varginha say strange beings, thought to be aliens, were seen in town. A surgeon named Italo Venturelli tells podcast host Jesse Michels that the spot where they appeared is a vacant lot that is still there today. He says the land is fenced off, people still come to visit it, and there is a plan to research the place."
